repository-code: https://github.com/astrosemantics/widgets_alnitak

abstract: >-
  A collection of astronomical observation widgets developed
  by Daniel Dubois for Astro-club Alnitak, based in La Martyre,
  Brittany, France.

  The software provides observation conditions, a night
  programme and a sky map to help amateur astronomers
  prepare their observing sessions.

